    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mawe ga kwizūkīja",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī lihanga ī lyose aho lyamala kūgūkīla ū mongo gwa Yolodani, ū SEEBA ūng'wīla ū Yoshwa gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Solanhyaga bagosha ikūmi na babīlī kūfuma ū mu banhū, ūmò kūfuma būlī lūganda; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ūbawīle basole mawe ikūmi n'abīlī kūfuma a ha gatī gatī ya mongo gwa Yolodani, bagīnje aho bīmīīlaga a bagabīji; bagabūūche muje nago ūko mukūlaala ū būjikū wa lelo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Yoshwa ūbitana ng'hana a banhū ab'ikūmi na babīlī abo waalī wabasolanhya kūfuma ū mu Baisilaeli, munhū ūmò kūfuma mu būlī lūganda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbawīla gīkī, “Jaagi ū kū būtongi w'isandīko lya ng'wa SEEBA Mulungu wing'we, būlī ng'wene akasole iwe kūfuma a ha gatī gatī ya mongo gwa Yolodani alīsesele h'ibega; a mawe gabize gīt'ūmo būūli ūbūkūmi bo ng'anda ja Baisilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Galabize lūmeng'ho lwing'we, ū kū shikū ja kū būtongi a baana bing'we ūlū būmubūūja gīkī, ‘A mawe geneya galī na makūlū kī?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukūbawīla gīkī, a minzī ga mongo gwa Yolodani gakagabanhīka kūlwa nguno y'isandīko lya būlagane bo ng'wa SEEBA. Aho līlīkījiwa ū mongo gwa Yolodani, ū ng'hūūmo gwa minzī ga mongo gwenūyo gūkatīnīka. Na lūūlū a mawe genaya gakūbiza ga kūbizūkīja a Baisilaeli shikū jose.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana a Baisilaeli bīīta gīt'ūmo akabalagīīlīla ū Yoshwa. Būsola mawe ikūmi na abīlī kūfuma a ha gatī gatī ya mongo gwa Yolodani, kūlenganīla nū wingī bo ng'anda ja Baisilaeli; ūmo SEEBA walī wang'wīlīla Yoshwa. Būgabūūcha būja nago ū kū ng'hambī yabo būūkagatūūla henaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yoshwa ūtūūla mawe gangī ikūmi na abīlī ū mu mongo gwa Yolodani, a ha ng'wanya gwa mawe ayo gakīnjiwa aho jalī jipandile mhambala ja bagabīji abo baalī balībūūkije ī lisandīko lya būkaanīji; gataalī galīho hoi kūshisha nī lelo īyī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bagabīji abo baalī balībūūkije ī lisandīko bakikala bīmīīlile ū mu mongo gwa Yolodani kūshisha a banhū būgwīta būlī mhayo ūyo SEEBA walī wanagīīla ū Yoshwa, gīt'ūmo Musa walī wanagīīla ū Yoshwa; a banhū būkangīlīja ū kūkīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho baamalīīla ū kūkīla, ī lisandīko lya ng'wa SEEBA na a bagabīji bandya kūshimīza bajile ū kū ntambūko gwa mongo, pye a banhū balolile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na a bagosha ba lūganda lwa Lubeni nū lwa ng'wa Gaadi, nī nusu ya lūganda lwa Manase būkīla babūūkije shilanga shabo; nīyo a bene baalī kū būtongi wa Baisilaeli, gīt'ūmo Musa walī wabawīīlīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baalī gītī banhū shihūmbī makūmi anè abo bakakīla babūūkije shilanga shabo kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA, bamalīīlile kūja kū būlūgū mu mbuga ja Yeliko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū lūshikū lwenūlo ū SEEBA ūngūngūhya ū Yoshwa ū mu miso ga Baisilaeli a bose; būnkūja no pyī ū mu shikū ja būlamu wakwe, gīt'ūmo baalī bankūgīgije Musa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.4.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ya kūmalīīja ha kūkīla mongo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū SEEBA ūng'wīla ū Yoshwa gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Bawīlage lūūlū nabo a bagabīji abo balībūūkije ī lisandīko lya Būkaanīji bafume ū mu mongo gwa Yolodani.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana ū Yoshwa ūbalagīla a bagabīji alībawīla, “Fumagi lūūlū ning'we ū mu mongo gwa Yolodani.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bagabīji būfuma ū mu mongo balībūūkije ī lisandīko lya būlagane bo ng'wa SEEBA. Aho batūūla dūhū ī mhambala jabo hasī nyūūmu, haho na haho a minzī ga mongo gwa Yolodani gūshoka ūmo giikalīlaga na kale, ū mongo gwenūyo gūtaala hangī gīt'ūmo gwaalī dūhū a ha kwandya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū bīnga a ha mongo gwa Yolodani mu lūshikū lw'ikūmi lwa ng'weji gwa kwandya, būlinha bajile Giligali būūkatūūla ng'hambī kwenūko, kīya ya Yeliko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yoshwa ūgatūūla Giligali a mawe ay'ikūmi na abīlī ayo baalī baagasola kūfuma mu mongo gwa Yolodani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūbawīla a Baisilaeli gīkī, “Ū kū shikū ja kū būtongi a banhū ba shibyalīlwe shing'we ūlū būbabūūja a babyaji babo, ‘A mawe genaya galī na makūlū kī ī gete?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukūbawīla gīkī, ‘A Baisilaeli bakagūkīla ū mongo gwa Yolodani balīshimīza hasī nyūūmu.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū SEEBA Mulungu wing'we akagūkamya ū mongo mu būtongi wing'we, kūshisha ng'ūkīla. Ū SEEBA Mulungu wing'we wītaga gīt'ūmo akīītīla kū Nyanza Yaaza, aho akagakamya a minzī gayo kūshisha tūūkīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū gwenūyū wagwītaga kūlwa kūbamanīīkīja pye a banhū ba mu sī gīkī, ū nkono go ng'wa SEEBA gūlī na būdūla; na a bing'we mubize na logohano shikū jose ū kūlī SEEBA Mulungu wing'we.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.4.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
